  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "It is a crop which is used both as food and fodder. It is a kharif crop
    which requires temperature between 21\xB0C to 27\xB0C and grows well in old alluvial
    soil. In some states like Bihar maize is grown in rabi season also. Use of modern
    inputs such as HYV seeds, fertilisers and irrigation have contributed to the
    increasing production of maize."
