  m_text: This is the second most important cereal crop. It is the main food crop,
    in north and north-western part of the country. This rabi crop requires a cool
    growing season and a bright sunshine at the time of ripening. It requires 50
    to 75 cm of annual rainfall evenly distributed over the growing season.
